    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kim Bedard-bouchard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107311673399955912658/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEFM7SzZUGTF5DpSXFTlLyG5YsGDGkeSaUfdBs9oVLJ09AmQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "The worst I've ever experienced! If you want to chase after your documents, not be told about the offers from the bank you choose (cashback promo), not be asked if you want to put the loan on a monthly or weekly basis, and what's more, I asked them not to transfer the payments to my account (they did it anyway), do business with them, otherwise I'll have warned you.\n\nIn addition to constantly demanding documents they already have and are unable to interpret.\n\nAnd blame the bank.\n\nThey'll surely respond and deny this fault and blame it on me, as they did to the others.",
        "time": 1755707265,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anne-Catherine Murphy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117387904651383048476/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJSvKP38kr2nLChoiBm5VTBXOkLBtJwT3V-5Uw0l5G7AGi3BA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We greatly appreciated our experience purchasing a property with Pierre-Olivier and his team. We had a tight deadline, and their service was very efficient in achieving this. Thank you again.",
        "time": 1755988870,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric Taillefer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106133269614617719275/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6P0ITb3Pgf8EN3sPQYtj91nORKZV5N62JZhUybO-MpyISCto=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Initially, I simply noted Mr. Janelle from DENVO Mortgages without providing a review. My mistake. Here is the correction.\n\nMr. Janelle expressed his displeasure with this simple note (see his text below), and I therefore undertook to clarify certain points. Please note that this review was written AFTER Mr. Janelle's response below.\n\nTo begin, despite the confidentiality agreement included at the end of each email exchange we had, Mr. Janelle did not hesitate to break the confidentiality between a financial institution and its client by publishing an excerpt of our exchanges below. So much for his \"professionalism\" and \"mutual respect.\"\n\nI have been in the real estate industry for over 25 years. I have therefore dealt with various banking institutions, mortgage brokers, and even private lenders to finance various projects.\n\nIf Mr. Janelle and I were unable to finalize a transaction, it wasn't personal. It's simply that I felt the amount of documentation he requested for a relatively straightforward financing application was disproportionate compared to the documents required by other banks, often without any justification. A client has the right to ask questions when documents are requested. Therefore, I decided to go to a reputable institution. That's all.\n\nIt seems my decision upset him.\n\nBut his response to my decision, which I won't publish here, is frankly unworthy of a financing professional. Hence the one out of five rating. His expertise and the work of his team are in no way in question.\n\nA failed transaction is not a sign of disrespect or a refusal to \"play as a team,\" Mr. Janelle; it is simply a business decision.",
        "time": 1744377456,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "naomie sileunou",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100358892427855740172/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIsULNfRV9avsxHV2-LGqhg3ikYezvBIOvZsjWXo7nyImGqzg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "What wonderful service and support! Thank you for your dedication and availability.\nThanks to your support, I was able to realize my dream, which wasn't coming true with the bank.\nI recommend you 200% and I hope to continue working with you in the near future.",
        "time": 1739489052,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lemaillet Balaks",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109580948225183500358/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkislfw41rkNmbpcWWN9nwbXzEK5kCNDo-_mwiYJn3CiI2vaCk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "If you're someone who wants to invest in short-term rental properties (like a chalet) but have no experience with mortgages,\n\nI recommend DENVO Mortgages.\n\nPierre-Olivier and his team supported us throughout our project from start to finish, and even after the paperwork was finalized, they continued to be available. They are a very professional, attentive, and responsive team that guides you toward the best solution.\n\nThank you to the whole team! 🙏🫶",
        "time": 1733802871,
        "translated": true
      }
